Working with Agile development methodologies and product tracking solutions such as Version Control Systems (e.g. Github), Issue Management Systems (e.g. JIRA, Azure DevOps etc.);
Working with the leadership team and peers across pursuits, pre-sales activities, and delivery of engagements;
Supporting pursuit teams in reviewing RFP requirements and building corresponding content to respond to pursuits;
