The SFA role is a highly versatile position that provides the foundation, guidance, and exposure towards a challenging and dynamic career. The SFA will be involved at various depths with financial reporting, liquidity management, business planning, valuations, and forecasting. Will work closely with other finance team members including CFO, and other business groups (operations, sales, etc.)
Responsibilities
Prepare consolidated financial statements on a quarterly and annual basis and actively participate and lead the resolution of technical accounting issues, including coordination with auditors;
