University degree in computer science or related discipline with major IT course work and considerable experience in the IT field demonstrating an advancement in a variety of roles;
OR
must have a University degree or related two-year IT diploma from a recognized College or University with a focus on programming and application development and extensive experience in the IT field demonstrating an advancement in a variety of roles;
